{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LUjT30JOm3bY1UNL5vK2wg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:24.016840+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LUjT30JOm3bY1UNL5vK2wg","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/1cm5T70SibJ1P1kmanNZhRYLIqbo7La1FYTMKYA6KAwricM35SsmbiacZkGlkcA6d92x2ZBECdfX2ODmxriahHOqOg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>北京师范大学化学学院拟于2025年7月1日-3日举办“2025年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营”活动。本期夏令营面向全国各高校本科生，旨在促进优秀大学生之间的交流，帮助青年学生了解北京师范大学化学学院的科研、教学等情况。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>本期夏令营拟招收营员80人左右。申请工作自即日开始。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>北京师范大学化学学院将为入选且全程参加夏令营活动的营员提供活动期间的食宿费用（北京高校学生不提供住宿费用）。</span></span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>1</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/1cm5T70SibJ2iaobKSY9sCpia2VoMEd1UZaNSLiafNFI3VK66ib1PkyNkyoXaEtNCXjUhELa84B0ibHX9YosqLvegVzQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱祖国，品德良好，遵纪守法，诚实守信，学风端正，身心健康；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.全国高水平大学全日制本科三年级在校生（2026年应届毕业生）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.本科成绩原则上在全年级同专业综合排名的前20%，达到所在高校推荐免试要求者优先；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.对化学学科有浓厚科研兴趣，有志于学术研究工作，并有较强的科研潜力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.英语水平良好。</span></span></p><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>2</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>报名材料</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/1cm5T70SibJ2iaobKSY9sCpia2VoMEd1UZaNSLiafNFI3VK66ib1PkyNkyoXaEtNCXjUhELa84B0ibHX9YosqLvegVzQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1. 《北京师范大学全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表》1份，在申请系统中填写后下载，签字、盖章；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 个人陈述1份（关于个人学术背景、曾经做过的研究工作以及未来学习和研究的计划、目标等），模板见系统；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. 本科前3年（或前5学期）所修全部课程的成绩单（学校教务部门盖章），总评成绩排名证明1份（负责人签字，盖院系教务公章，如有不实将取消入营资格）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4. 获奖证书扫描复印件1份；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5. 国家英语四、六级考试成绩等体现英语水平的复印件1份；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6. 可体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果以及其它证明材料；</span></span></p><p><span><span>7. 两位高级职称专家（正高或副高）的推荐信（专家签字）。（推荐信模板阅读原文即可获取）</span></span></p><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>3</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/1cm5T70SibJ2iaobKSY9sCpia2VoMEd1UZaNSLiafNFI3VK66ib1PkyNkyoXaEtNCXjUhELa84B0ibHX9YosqLvegVzQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>申请人请于</span><span>2025年6月15日23:59</span><span>前登录北京师范大学夏令营申请系统（https://xly.bnu.edu.cn/xly）按要求进行报名，提交相关材料；同时，将以上报名材料1-7项按顺序制成一个PDF文件，用</span><span>“2025优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请+所报考的二级专业方向（例如物理化学）+姓名+手机号码”</span><span>命名，发送到bnuchem-yjs@foxmail.com，过期不再接受申请。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>咨询邮箱：</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/1cm5T70SibJ2iaobKSY9sCpia2VoMEd1UZaLtA8hibpxLhQEl0nuUzubA1aOdPcTfL8NjHAjPnGjzOC4YSSyqxAOrg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span>（<span>为了避免数字及字母识别错误，建议咨询时直接复制邮件地址）</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>4</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>材料审核及营员名单</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/1cm5T70SibJ2iaobKSY9sCpia2VoMEd1UZaNSLiafNFI3VK66ib1PkyNkyoXaEtNCXjUhELa84B0ibHX9YosqLvegVzQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>审核工作和营员名单由北京师范大学化学学院专家组负责。营员审核工作将于</span><span>2025年6月23日结束</span><span>，营员名单将由学科联系老师直接通知本人（以电子邮件形式），</span></span><strong><span><span>营员要在邮件指定日期前，确认是否参加本期夏令营，逾期未确认视为放弃资格。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>5</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>日程安排</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/1cm5T70SibJ2iaobKSY9sCpia2VoMEd1UZaNSLiafNFI3VK66ib1PkyNkyoXaEtNCXjUhELa84B0ibHX9YosqLvegVzQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/1cm5T70SibJ2Cr4b4YT9dvY5EJ9KTurh3I8Qibk7BRiaoMnf5jBLryVHABehFaOh0Tx2yibHZiaOFlW7BEusnZ5IibVw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>注：营员报到后要求全程参加所有活动。</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>具体活动日程另行通知；营员应遵守夏令营活动安排，全程按时参加活动，遵守纪律。</span></span></p><p><span><span>如有特殊情况影响夏令营日程，将会及时更新化学学院网站通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>请及时关注网站通知更新。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>6</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/1cm5T70SibJ2iaobKSY9sCpia2VoMEd1UZaNSLiafNFI3VK66ib1PkyNkyoXaEtNCXjUhELa84B0ibHX9YosqLvegVzQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>北京师范大学化学学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系人：唐老师、全老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>地址：北京市海淀区新街口外大街19号北京师范大学化学学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮编：100875</span></span></p><p><span><span>电话：010-58809779（唐老师） 010-58806691（全老师）</span></span></p><p><span><span>化学学院网址：http://www.chem.bnu.edu.cn/</span></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>审核丨唐权</span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/1cm5T70SibJ1P1kmanNZhRYLIqbo7La1FYibD945fOPSIxrP1rOYYF4TjaP4I1UicM12zbpUibiacEjHevBNSIxabsQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"e0f9fff7e41a6e67d03000f4b3fa3fe74464e9f80902e1dc0026e0c45af06d8d","textLength":1273,"sourceSha256":"d53cfd127c3f7b5771c0a7624f1912f67fc61cd1cfec016538dfce513b0ce970","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],